Narrator: Near the lake, a thin, weird man sits alone, flinching every time someone walks too close.
join Vlad (Vlad_normal) center
catherine: Um, hello. Sorry to bother you. Mind if I sit?
Vlad (Vlad_confused): *Flinches*...Oh. Um. N-no, not really, I am Vlad. But who are you? I've never seen you around town.
catherine: My name is Catherine. I am a newcomer here, and I am looking for something. I don’t know if you can help me.
Vlad (Vlad_talk): And what are you looking for?
- Tell him you are looking for something
	catherine: Is it true, are there monsters living in and around this town?
	Vlad (Vlad_confused): What kind of question is that? Where did you hear that from?
	catherine: I was just wondering.
	Vlad (Vlad_happy): Tell me straight. You are looking for something, are you?
	catherine: Yes I am. And it has something to do with the creatures there.
	Vlad (Vlad_angry): *Flinching* They're dangerous. People who go looking don't always come back the same. You shouldn't go looking either.
	leave Vlad
	set {ChapterTracking.is_evil} = true
	set {EndingTracking.catherine_sympathy} -= 1.0
- Tell him about your mother's tales
	catherine: My mother told me tales of magical creatures in this town. The kinds like in fairy tales.
	catherine: And I was just wondering if...
	Vlad (Vlad_confused): Hahaha, fairy tales?
	Vlad (Vlad_angry): I think you are mistaken, young girl. There is no such thing. Especially here.
	catherine: I know but I just...
	Vlad (Vlad_angry): You know? Well... why are you searching for that then?
	Vlad (Vlad_happy): Anyway, if you ever find it, tell me. It's a great way to be famous and known by everyone.
	Vlad (Vlad_angry): Fairy tales, really...
	leave Vlad
	catherine: Guess I have no luck today. Well, my questions are also really weird. I need to find another way to find the creatures.
	set {ChapterTracking.is_evil} = false
	set {EndingTracking.catherine_sympathy} += 1.0
